Dear Alex,

Larkspur Mutual is a member-owned general insurer with about 410,000 policies across home,
motor and travel. We are replacing our claims system, ClaimsOne, a 2004 in-house
application that runs on the same mainframe as our policy administration system.

Scope of the RFP:

- A claims platform covering first notification of loss (FNOL), triage, handling,
  reserving, settlement and recoveries for home, motor and travel claims.
- Online claim submission for members, with photo upload, and a broker view.
- Integration with our policy administration system (mainframe), our finance ERP for
  reserve and payment postings, our bank for claim payments, and our document system for
  letters.
- Migration of open claims and seven years of closed claims history.

Industry: Insurance (general insurance, mutual). Products we expect: claims management
platform, member self-service, payments integration, data migration.

Please join a discovery call on Thursday 15 October with our COO Aoife Brennan, head of
IT Ronan Gallagher and claims operations lead Martina Kelly. Responses are due on
27 November 2026.

Regards,
